## 4. Architecture monorepo

Structure du dépôt d'implémentation de référence (branche `impl`).

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph repo[Dépôt AKORIS]
        subgraph spe[Spécification — main]
            constitution[constitution/]
            registry[registry/]
            docs[docs/]
        end

        subgraph code[Implémentation — impl]
            packages["packages/"]
            apps["apps/"]
            scripts["scripts/"]
            selfhosting["self-hosting .akoris/"]
        end
    end

    packages --> core["@akoris/core"]
    packages --> cli["@akoris/cli"]
    apps --> dashboard["dashboard"]
```

